---
import { skills } from "../data/portfolio";
---

<section id="about" class="section border-y border-black/10 bg-white/50">
  <div class="page-shell grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr]">
    <div>
      <p class="section-kicker">About</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Curious builder, steady teammate.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-6 text-lg leading-8 text-[#45423d]">
      <p>
        Since childhood, my fascination with technology has pushed me to keep expanding my skills across languages,
        frameworks, and user-centered software. I have an Associate's degree in Web Development, completed the
        Rutgers Coding Bootcamp, and have continued sharpening my engineering fundamentals through Formation.
      </p>
      <p>
        My work centers on JavaScript, React, HTML, and CSS, with a practical eye for interfaces that are clear,
        responsive, and maintainable. Away from code, I am usually snowboarding, cooking, or playing basketball.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-2" aria-label="Technical skills">
        {skills.map((skill) => (
          <span class="rounded-lg border border-black/15 bg-white px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-extrabold leading-none shadow-sm">
            {skill}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
